!       ! %%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%% Formulations used in GABLS (Good for z/L < 1)%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
!       ! %%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%% Also apeearing in Hogstorm, BLM, 1988)%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
